    "summary": "The Somali government has rejected online reports that it owns a historic building in Berlin's Friedenau district. Deputy Foreign Minister Ali Omar Balcad clarified that the state owns no such property and the embassy operates from rented premises.",
    "content": "Somalia's Federal Government has formally denied owning a historic building in Berlin's Friedenau district, following unverified social media claims that Mogadishu holds valuable real estate in the German capital. Deputy Foreign Minister Ali Omar Balcad stated on Tuesday that no such property belongs to the Somali state, and confirmed that the country's embassy in Germany operates from rented offices.\n\nThis denial is not the first of its kind. The Somali Foreign Ministry has previously pushed back against similar narratives suggesting the government owns foreign assets. Officials have repeatedly called such claims baseless, urging the public to rely on official statements rather than unconfirmed online reports.\n\nThe building in question, located in a residential area of Berlin, has become the subject of speculation in recent days. No independent sources have verified the property's ownership, and the Somali government has not provided further details about the origin of the rumors.\n\nFor the Somali diaspora, many of whom have faced questions about their homeland's assets abroad, this clarification serves as an important correction. It reinforces that Somalia's diplomatic missions operate on tight budgets, often relying on rented spaces, and that unverified claims about state-owned properties can undermine trust in official institutions.\n\nThe incident highlights broader challenges for Somalia in managing its international image amid persistent misinformation. Government officials have emphasized their commitment to transparency, advising citizens to consult official channels for accurate information about state holdings.\n\nRead the original report from Radio Dalsan here: https://radiodalsan.com/2026/07/29/somalia-denies-owning-berlin-building/?utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=somalia-denies-owning-berlin-building",
